.TH FL-AUTOSTART 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.0" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-autostart \- start XDG autostart applications
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-autostart\fR [\fB\-\-list\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Starts the applications in \fI~/.config/autostart\fR and \fI/etc/xdg/autostart\fR
that are meant for this desktop. \fB\-\-list\fR only prints them.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfl-wm\fR(1), \fBfl-session\fR(1), \fBfl-panel\fR(1)
